# One line-ending policy for every machine (macOS/Linux/Windows dev boxes):
# text files are LF in the repo AND in every working tree, so checkouts,
# diffs, and hashes are byte-identical across machines regardless of each
# clone's core.autocrlf. Windows toolchains (rustc, cargo, PowerShell 7,
# Git Bash) all handle LF sources; no .bat/.cmd files exist in this repo.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
crates/ay-pb/tests/instances/koops_mat12_11_identity_complement_red_capacity.pbp -filter -diff -merge text eol=lf
